List<List<String>> arts = new List<List<String>>{
  new List<String>{'rck-car-broken-1-4','RC: Steering is dead after a crash (upgraded RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Something Is Broken: steering is dead after a crash. Step-by-step guidance for upgraded models.','<h2>Steering is dead after a crash</h2><p>Applies to upgraded RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Something Is Broken.</p><ol><li>A grinding servo with no movement usually means stripped servo gears.</li><li>Replace the gear set or the servo.</li><li>Fit a quality servo saver to survive future impacts.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Something Is Broken'},
