  new List<String>{'rck-car-broken-3-0','RC: Differential leaking oil (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Something Is Broken: differential leaking oil. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Differential leaking oil</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Something Is Broken.</p><ol><li>Leaking silicone oil means worn X-ring seals.</li><li>Rebuild the diff with new seals and the correct oil weight.</li><li>Reassemble and check for smooth, quiet operation.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Something Is Broken'},
