  new List<String>{'rck-car-perf-0-0','RC: Reducing on-power oversteer (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Performance & Tuning: reducing on-power oversteer. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Reducing on-power oversteer</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Performance &amp; Tuning.</p><ol><li>Use a thicker rear differential oil.</li><li>Soften the rear or stiffen the front suspension.</li><li>Add rear toe-in and apply throttle smoothly.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Performance & Tuning'},
