  new List<String>{'rck-car-perf-1-0','RC: Vehicle rolls over in corners (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Performance & Tuning: vehicle rolls over in corners. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Vehicle rolls over in corners</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Performance &amp; Tuning.</p><ol><li>Lower the ride height and center of gravity.</li><li>Add sway bars front and rear.</li><li>Reduce excessive tire grip for the surface.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Performance & Tuning'},
