  new List<String>{'rck-car-perf-2-0','RC: Choosing a gear ratio for speed vs heat (1/10 scale RC car or truck)','Cars & Trucks / Performance & Tuning: choosing a gear ratio for speed vs heat. Step-by-step guidance for 1/10 scale models.','<h2>Choosing a gear ratio for speed vs heat</h2><p>Applies to 1/10 scale RC car or truck models. Category: Cars &amp; Trucks. Problem type: Performance &amp; Tuning.</p><ol><li>A larger pinion raises top speed but increases heat.</li><li>Change one or two teeth at a time.</li><li>Monitor motor and ESC temperatures after each change.</li></ol>','Cars & Trucks','Performance & Tuning'},
